[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644797875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102455#issuecomment-2644797875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102455","id":2644797875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dpGmz","user":{"login":"Lennart-Bours","id":20705172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzA1MTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20705172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours","html_url":"https://github.com/Lennart-Bours","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lennart-Bours/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T09:56:53Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T09:56:53Z","body":"I'm not sure if it is related, but I've noted that the life of [Tool] Resource objects in the editor is different from what I expected.\n\nOnce a scene holding a [Tool] Resource has been opened, or a [Tool] Resource on disc has been opened in the inspector, that Resource continues to live on in the editor. On subsequent recompilation, its parameterless constructor and its setters will be called.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644797875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870031443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102455#issuecomment-2870031443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102455","id":2870031443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rETRT","user":{"login":"SirTurlock","id":44070883,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDcwODgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44070883?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock","html_url":"https://github.com/SirTurlock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SirTurlock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-11T18:03:32Z","updated_at":"2025-05-11T20:09:08Z","body":"I'm on Godot 4.4 and I'm pretty sure that I have ran into this issue recently.\n\nI have a \"Namespace\" (no better name yet) node that kinda sits at the top of my scenes which I nest into other scenes (\"prefabs\"/game objects). I also have a \"Tagger/NodeRegistrator\" node that registers its parent into the Namespace. It subscribes to the parent's renamed event to detect name changes while the Namespace node generates a dynamic property list to show all registered children as read-only in the editor for clarity. So both nodes run as [Tool] scripts.\n\nI started getting `ERROR: Attempt to disconnect a nonexistent connection from 'Area3D:<Area3D#2407597688808>'. Signal: 'renamed', callable: 'Delegate::Invoke'.` messages and while at first I thought I may have mucked up the order of the signal connect/disconnect in the end it turned out that I only get this message on rebuild.\nThe predelete notification workaround doesn't seem to be working for me, but that might be an error on my part. However my error message is different from the ones described in this issue and the referenced issues. I did found similar stuff in #76708 and from a brief look the root cause was also associated with reloading the assemblies there.\n\nI'll investigate further.\n\nEdit:\nImplementing both workarounds together ISerializationListener  + predelete notification handling did solve the issue. I no longer receive the error message.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870031443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5935530305","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102455#issuecomment-5935530305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102455","id":5935530305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYckBQQ","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T16:14:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T16:14:30Z","body":"Closing as a duplicate of:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/70026\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86244","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5935530305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]